#! ia 1.0

@distribution ia-authoring-distribution
  meaning
    says "The release root of the IA authoring kit: its main ia-authoring system and its three part systems, ia-authoring-record, ia-authoring-host and ia-authoring-catalogue, with the probe, the governance lint, the trigger-evaluation runner, the trigger config reference and the two probe examples as kit assets."
    answers "Which records does this release ship?"
  distribution
    records [@system ia-authoring, @system ia-authoring-record, @system ia-authoring-host, @system ia-authoring-catalogue]
